assets/original_shader.blend and original_controls.blend contain editable native
graphs and controls; game images and preview objects are removed. Provenance is
recorded in assets/upstream.json. fetch_upstream.py and build_shader_library.py
record source preparation.

PMX Toon, Sphere, neutral packed inputs and shadow adaptation are informed by
PaoloESAN/gacha-setup 3.8.3, utils/mmd_model_adapter.py:
https://github.com/PaoloESAN/gacha-setup
MMD head naming and ownership were informed by Morningstar Festivity 1.0.2.1:
https://github.com/AstraMorningstar/Morningstar-Festivity-render-assistant

MMD Tools is a separately installed dependency. Hoyo-GI-Toon calls its public
import and bone-repair operators and does not bundle it or its shared Toon data.

FBX, layered-eye extensions, fabric/reflection modules and the previous display
workflow are retained in the v1.0.1 Git tag, outside the current runtime.
No game models, textures, material dumps or private validation projects ship.
